/li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Eldritch Casket/Statistics </i> </span>\n</p><p>One is received when you complete the <a href=\"#/quest/too-hot-to-handle-quest\">Too Hot to Handle Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Crystal%20Shard\">Blue Crystal Shard</a></li><li>Cyan Crystal Fragment</li><li>Eldritch Carpet</li><li>Eldritch Crystal</li><li>Floor Decorations</li><li>Folded Eldritch Carpet</li><li>Green Crystal Fragment</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Crystal%20Shard\">Green Crystal Shard</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Gem\">Green Gem</a></li><li>Light Sources</li><li>Plushie of Lavaworm</li><li>Quests</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Crystal%20Fragment\">Red Crystal Fragment</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/too-hot-to-handle-quest\">Too Hot to Handle Quest</a></li><li>Valuables</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Crystal%20Shard\">Violet Cr